# 2.1011.0 (#5713): the build context of docker-compose.yml (build: .) is the install folder of install.sh. Its database folder
# pgdata/ belongs to the postgres container (user 999, mode 0700) - docker compose build stopped on it with
# "open .../pgdata: permission denied" - and data/, secret/ and .env hold your tasks, backups, the server key and passwords:
# none of them is sent to the image build (the Dockerfile copies only program files). Patterns start at this folder only.
pgdata
data
secret
.env
.env.bak
.install.log
.git
